OL,3,GNEWSAPumpkin patch saved by lucky
OL,4,Adecision last year
OL,5,
OL,6,FSimon Walton, farmer at Baydale Farm in
OL,7,FDarlington, said they were really badly
OL,8,Fimpacted by the droughts last year, but
OL,9,Fa lucky decision in the aftermath, has
OL,10,Fmeant they can open as usual this year.
